---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import IntakeForm from '../components/IntakeForm.astro';
import { renewalStageField } from '../lib/intake-context';
import HeroBanner from '../components/HeroBanner.astro';
import RequirementsIntakeCta from '../components/RequirementsIntakeCta.astro';
import ProcessClusterNav from '../components/ProcessClusterNav.astro';

const title = 'Portugal HQA Visa Renewal - Next Card After Approval';
const metaTitle = `${title} | Portugal HQA Residency`;
const metaDescription =
  'Portugal HQA visa renewal in 2026 is the next card file: activity, absences, and timing, after stay rules and before you start a permanent residence filing.';
---

<Layout title={metaTitle} description={metaDescription}>
  <article>
    <header>
      <HeroBanner
        image="/images/portugal-hqa-visa-renewal-office.jpg"
        alt="White houses with terracotta roofs stacked on a sea cliff above breaking waves"
        title={title}
        items={[
          { href: '/', label: 'Home' },
          { href: '/portugal-hqa-visa', label: 'Portugal HQA Visa' },
          { href: '/portugal-hqa-visa-application', label: 'Application' },
          { label: 'Renewal' },
        ]}
      />
      <div class="bg-background">
        <div class="site-container py-24 md:py-32">
        <p class="max-w-3xl">
          Portugal HQA visa renewal is the later file that keeps highly qualified activity residence in force when the card’s validity ends. It is not the first lodging sequence and not permanent residence. Stay obligations that run during the card’s life are on
          <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-residency-requirements" class="inline-link">HQA visa residency requirements</a>.
          When enough legal residence has accrued, the next statute may be
          <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-permanent-residency" class="inline-link">HQA visa permanent residency</a>,
          which is a different application.
        </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-background-alt">
      <div class="site-container max-w-3xl py-24 md:py-32">
        <section>
          <h2>What a renewal file has to show</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            The desk will look for continued highly qualified activity with a host that still supports the permit, updated identity and record items, and a travel pattern that has not broken the residence rules in force. Changing employer or dropping the role without a new basis is a renewal problem, not a surprise to raise on the last day of validity. Confirm the 2026 AIMA renewal window (how many days before expiry you may or must file) on the current form.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>

    <RequirementsIntakeCta
      source="/portugal-hqa-visa-renewal"
      image="/images/portugal-hqa-visa-renewal-cta-divider.jpg"
      alt="Lisbon office street used on the HQA visa renewal page"
      heading="Map the next HQA card before the current one expires"
      copy="Not sure what a renewal file has to show? Enter your details and our advisory team can help point you in the right direction."
    />

    <div class="bg-background-alt">
      <div class="site-container max-w-3xl py-24 md:py-32">
        <section>
          <h2>Timing against the card</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            Lodge while the card is still valid whenever the instructions allow it. A first
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-application" class="inline-link">HQA visa application</a>
            wait is not a reliable forecast of renewal speed; renewal sits on a different queue. If the card will expire during analysis, ask the desk what evidence of a pending renewal you can carry. Do not assume an expired card plus a portal screenshot is enough to travel.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-24">
          <h2>Renewal is not permanent residence</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            Repeated renewals can lead, after the statutory period of legal stay, to a permanent residence file. That file has its own absence tests and evidence. Citizenship is later still. Keep using this page for the next temporary card. Use
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-permanent-residency" class="inline-link">permanent residency</a>
            when that is the live question. The journey back to admission tests is
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-requirements" class="inline-link">HQA visa requirements</a>.
            The program overview is the
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa" class="inline-link">Portugal HQA visa</a>
            guide.
          </p>
        </section>

        <ProcessClusterNav current="/portugal-hqa-visa-renewal" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-cta-tint">
      <div class="site-container flex flex-col items-start pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-20 md:pb-14">
        <h2 class="max-w-3xl">Start the renewal against the card date, not against a forum average</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl">
          This page is informational. It is not legal, tax, or immigration advice. Renewal windows and evidence lists change. An advisor can read your host situation and absences against the current AIMA instructions.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 w-full min-w-0 max-w-3xl">
          {/* TODO: no backend yet */}
          <IntakeForm
            source="/portugal-hqa-visa-renewal"
            surface="cta"
            contextField={renewalStageField}
            submitLabel="Get renewal guidance →"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
